  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHq/578",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a99c3b203156856cdcd584d0a84df16fea94a42\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a99c3b203156856cdcd584d0a84df16fea94a42\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0993012bf8723c9bfae80db10fd4bc4cafc9e8e5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0993012bf8723c9bfae80db10fd4bc4cafc9e8e5\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>손잡이 쪽에 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&lt;물주머니&gt;를 터트리면</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">기체가 발생</span>하며</b><br><b><u>광선검이 팽팽해집니다.</u></b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>한동안 수입이 안되서</b><br><b>계속 못샀었는데요 </b><br><b>ㅠㅡㅠ <br><br><br>오랜만에 검색을 해보니</b><br>&#160;<b>판매합니다. </b><br><b>1통에 3개 들어 600원 정도 합니다.</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">착한 가격!! ^O^!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>포털 검색어 : &#39;</b><b>광선검&#39;<br><br></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff9f055028b16c063c69e88ce8e66557165a62e0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff9f055028b16c063c69e88ce8e66557165a62e0\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7718df0e13325891955992d49b2de9ae05cfa6cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7718df0e13325891955992d49b2de9ae05cfa6cb\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><b>뜯어보면 </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">흰가루</span>와 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">투명한 액체 파우치</span>가 있습니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>액체를 터트리면,</b><br><b>반응이 손끝에 느껴지며</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">차가워집니다! ^^!</span></b><br>&#160;<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb38842923e76d776e097d900ef63ae710939c19\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb38842923e76d776e097d900ef63ae710939c19\" data-origin-width=\"1063\" data-origin-height=\"1508\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><b><br>전에 팔던 얘가 <br>더 부피감도 있고 좋긴한데<br>얘는 아직 수입할 생각이 없나봅니다 ㅠ<br><br><br>흰가루를...분석해보지 않았는지만</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">구하기 쉽고, 싸고, 안전한 걸</span>로는</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>과탄산나트륨 + 물 → 탄산나트륨 + 산소 + 물</b><br><span style=\"color: #1A1918;\">&#160;</span>2Na2CO3·3H2O2 → 2Na2CO3 + 3H2O + 3O<br>&#160;<br><br><b>???<br><br><br>음.....</b><br>&#160;<br><br>&#160;<br><b>이거 뭘까요.<br><br></b><br><b>ㅠㅡㅠ<br><br></b></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
